  "body": "## Downloads\n\nSame files as 0.2.0, version 0.2.1: Windows, macOS (Apple silicon and Intel) and Linux zips, the Android APK and the iPhone IPA. On a desktop, **Update** in the app installs it.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- **Windows: the space bar typed nothing** in text boxes (messages, search, everything). It types a space again.\n- **Windows: AltGr characters** (such as @, { or € on German, French and other keyboards) now type instead of being treated as shortcuts.\n- **macOS: Option characters** (such as @ as Option+L on a German Mac) now type.\n"
